    {
      "id": 99,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 55
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### What's here\n\nLog streams kldload's **promtail** ships to **Loki** in real time. Click any panel header \u2192 Explore for full LogQL drilldown.\n\n### If the systemd-journal panel is blank\n\nPromtail's `journal` scraper needs read access to `/run/log/journal/<machine-id>/`. On fresh kldload installs the promtail user may not be in the `systemd-journal` group. Fix: `sudo usermod -aG systemd-journal promtail && sudo systemctl restart promtail`. The ZED + kldload-apps + ZFS dbgmsg + klab streams work without that \u2014 they're file-tail scrapers, not journald."
      }
    }
